---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import TopNav from "../components/ui/TopNav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/ui/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms • VD Animation">
  <TopNav brand="VD ANIMATION" />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-28 pb-16 text-white">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-white/65">Last updated: {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-7 text-white/75">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          VD Animation provides digital artwork and animation services. Availability is limited and may depend
          on current workload and project complexity.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Orders & communication</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Orders are initiated via an external order form or direct contact (e.g., email/Instagram). By submitting
          an order request, you agree to provide accurate information and references needed for production.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Payment & deposits</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          A deposit (typically 50% of the quoted price) may be required before work begins. Accepted payment methods
          may include Wise, PayPal, crypto, and other methods as specified in the order form. If alternative payment
          methods are used (e.g., skins/gift cards), pricing may be adjusted to match market value.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Revisions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Revisions may be included depending on the selected package. Minor adjustments are typically included.
          Major changes after approval (e.g., changing character, pose, or concept) may require additional fees.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Delivery & timelines</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Delivery times depend on complexity and queue. Estimated timelines are not guarantees. If you have a strict
          deadline, you must communicate it before work begins.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Refunds</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Due to the custom nature of digital commissions, refunds are generally not available once work has started.
          If a project is canceled before work begins, any paid deposit may be refunded at our discretion, minus fees
          charged by payment providers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Usage rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Unless otherwise agreed in writing, delivered artworks are for personal use (e.g., Steam profile, avatars).
          Commercial usage or licensing must be requested explicitly and may require an additional fee.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Third-party links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This site may include links to third-party services. We are not responsible for content, policies, or
          practices of external sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/90">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For questions regarding these Terms, please contact us using the email address displayed on the site.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

</Layout>
